 stock (the &#8220;Existing Warrants&#8221;), which are exercisable for an equal number of shares of common stock at an exercise price of&#160;</span><span style="color:#212529;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_j4ho2zcJW0uZFsxJGx4i1A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_ZqCLlJ0xIkKrBvk8DgQe8g">1,484.25</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;">.&#160;</span>The Company offered the holders of the Existing Warrants an inducement period whereby the Company agreed to issue new warrants (the &#8220;Inducement Warrants&#8221;) to purchase up to a number of shares of common stock equal to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightPercentageOfWarrantsIssued" scale="-2" id="Narr_FpvGZAkgOECXB9iDCFGaew">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the number of shares of common stock issued pursuant to the exercise by the holders of the Existing Warrants, for cash, at a reduced exercise price equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_j4ho2zcJW0uZFsxJGx4i1A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightReducedExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_2CMpFkIyg02J591DuOY6gw">272.25</ix:nonFraction>. Each holder agreed to exercise&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightInitialExercisePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_o1-ZUn8TtkaPnb4Pcfrr5w">60</ix:nonFraction>% of their Existing Warrants immediately (the &#8220;Initial Exercise&#8221;) and will exercise the remaining&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePercentageAfterEffectivenessDate" scale="-2" id="Narr_P9ZpB3JYdEyChFUIdYCOLQ">40</ix:nonFraction>% within&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExerciseTermAfterEffectivenessDate" id="Narr_gfBK-oRzIUmtbOf2lbAb8w">30</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;calendar days following the Effectiveness Date (as defined in the agreements), provided that the Company&#8217;s stock price at such time equals or exceeds 90% of the Nasdaq Minimum Price on that date (the &#8220;Additional Exercise&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;">The net proceeds to the Company from the Initial Exercise, after deducting placement agent fees and the Company&#8217;s offering expenses were&#160;</span><span style="color:#212529;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" scale="3" id="Narr_a0z-Vaud30mQIU-lZu6VLA">5,075</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;">. In connection with the Initial Exercise, the Company issued&#160;</span><span style="color:#212529;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_q7BNEPKVjEKwsMu9-1K2ig">19,970</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;">&#160;Inducement Warrants.&#160;</span>Of the aggregate net proceeds, the Company was obligated under the Debentures of the convertible senior secured credit facility to repay outstanding debt in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2025_To_4_29_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_April2025InducementWarrantsMember_MqXG2CQltESh8ZYVzhcKdg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_OkXggWsUokGEOaHZ4U_-Wg">1,017</ix:nonFraction>. The Company also measured the fair value of the Existing Warrants before and after the modification to decrease the cash exercise price, and concluded there was no&#160;incremental fair value to be recorded as issuance costs due to the alternative cashless exercise features of the warrants.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Additionally, on April 29, 2025, the Company entered into amendments with the holders of the outstanding warrants issued on October 24, 2024, which adjusted the provisions of the warrants regarding recapitalizat