nder various commercial agreements for an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_DiOembjfo0WcvNBsnx1UfQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_owoJfpSMFU6a4_RMkcaHDg">15</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an effective average price per share of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_5g7wEIdmJ0Cbt3Y7oCDORA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_mnCOrg4dE0mDW3IfctziGg">99,670.50</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">During the third quarter of 2024, the Company settled an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_O2X1gBzFdEqcwberzmejkw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="3" id="Narr_JohupB9tpEaY7WbshP25fg">525</ix:nonFraction> of outstanding indebtedness under various commercial and licensing agreements for an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_O2X1gBzFdEqcwberzmejkw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_OHgH0I9-4060oRVoWN9IqA">38</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock at an effective average price per share of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_L0NtEMYGeU2vcq