 the agreement, the Company sold <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_3_3_2025_To_3_3_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_7xoeyPB6Skqrs1qqw6DX6Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_TnLgqjHoWEiAykhwtdCu0A">5</ix:nonFraction>% original issuance discount senior secured debentures with an aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_n_fOcf87bUmg_rn9d5h2kQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_cRTHACUD2EaUERX97UZVuA">21,053</ix:nonFraction>. The Debentures bear interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_n_fOcf87bUmg_rn9d5h2kQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_cizQsQ2VB0-wnniF7qHCFw">7</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, payable monthly in arrears as of the last trading day of each month and on the maturity date. The Debentures had a maturity date of March 3, 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">In connection with the sale of the Debentures, the Company issued warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_IGXm5zco30WhIwM27wxsnA">7</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock for an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_n8BfRdGfi0q_-CxvMaJM8w">950,130</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;JGB Warrants&#8221;), which had an initial fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:WarrantsFairValueDisclosure" scale="3" id="Narr_iPGFBCq1s0SgLfCbXRxyNg">4,475</ix:nonFraction> net of issuance costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsNet" scale="3" id="Narr_V1a057yenE-2ufpDvKSMpw">139</ix:nonFraction>. On June 22, 2023, as a result of the June 19, 2023 offering, the Company&#8217;s outstanding JGB warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_Tw72X9_VKU2C_TSD0FJemA">7</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock for an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2025_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_a8_Y6RvijE2g-e8a-BEibQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_FY4PI1h3V0C4uj-K8N6LLg">950,130</ix:nonFraction> per share were automatically adjusted to be $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_6_22_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_E1iY8p-im0GcKai96xk5gA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_9zyWxkSyXU2LqhT2n1hIBA">637,295</ix:nonFraction> exercise price for up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_22_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_E1iY8p-im0GcKai96xk5gA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_l62f12FqYUKxvgZ2S1avVw">11</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_6_22_2023_To_6_22_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_JgbWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_sECkkqUbcE-9QhAo5BPQIQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xxii:WarrantsAntiDilutionAdjustments" scale="3" id="Narr_5PM6w7P440OpV2_tMORJeQ">no</ix:nonFraction> further anti-dilution adjustments on such warrants.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On October 16, 2023, the Company entered into a Waiver and Amendment Agreement (the &#8220;October &#160;Amendment&#8221;) with each of the subsidiaries of the Company executing the Debentures, the Holders and the Agent, pursuant to which, among other things, (a) the Holders waived an event of default under Section 7(d) of the Debentures which required the Company to achieve revenue of at least $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:RevenueDebenturesAgreementAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_ZKMi9AcT0U6UAii1nwtFYw">18,500</ix:nonFraction> for the quarter ended September 30, 2023 (the &#8220;waiver&#8221;), (b) the parties agreed to amend Schedule E of the Debentures to reduce the Revenue Target (as such term is defined in the Debentures), for the quarter ended December 31, 2023, to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AmendedRevenueDebenturesAgreementAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_doqERB9PZEy0ig7xWiA1Fg">15,500</ix:nonFraction>, and (c) the Company agreed to release to the Purchasers the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AmountRequiredInEscrowFund" scale="3" id="Narr_7FfnN6i-MECpikd-zIae3w">7,500</ix:nonFraction> that the Company was required to maintain in a separate account (the &#8220;Escrow Funds&#8221;) which Escrow Funds were applied to, and reduce, the outstanding principal amount of the Debentures on a dollar-for-dollar basis.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">As additional consideration for the waiver, the Company agreed to assign, transfer and convey to the Agent, the Company&#8217;s entire right, title and interest in and to (i) the Promissory Note made by J&amp;N Real Estate Company, L.L.C. (&#8220;J&amp;N&#8221;) payable to the Company in the principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_wmT1K39ehkWqq448mXqd8A">3,800</ix:nonFraction> and (ii) the Deed of Trust, Assignment of Rents, Security Agreement and Fixture Filing dated June 30, 2021, between J&amp;N, as borrower, for the benefit of the Company, as lender (collectively, the &#8220;Pledged Indebtedness&#8221;). Upon assignment of the Pledged Indebtedness, the Company recognized the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PledgedIndebtednessNonmonetaryTransaction" scale="3" id="Narr_OsdFwYDhXUuC12e5N2crSw">2,600</ix:nonFraction> of consideration in exchange to be applied as a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ReductionOfPutPriceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_rN6srMdHVUmegdK0NgwRVA">2,000</ix:nonFraction> reduction of the Put Price (as defined below), $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:BalanceReductionOfDebentures" scale="3" id="Narr__Hul2RcK4k-gM40v8FLgRg">600</ix:nonFraction> reduction of the outstanding principal amount of Debentures and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSecuritizationOfFinancialAssets" scale="3" id="Narr_2-7l1nE_RU2yFiAWaRGGWw">895</ix:nonFraction> loss on sale of financial asset.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">In connection with the waiver, the Company and Holders agreed to exercise the outstanding put provision to redeem <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_IUKSv1uy3UKCrrH1OaflCw">4</ix:nonFraction> warrants for an aggregate put price equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:WarrantAggregatePutPrice" scale="3" id="Narr_UZA59p5Zc0-QIb2ni5Xv6w">2,500</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;Put Price&#8221;), which was concurrently reduced by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_10_16_2023_-5BFxdnMk0Kdw4fe59k4oQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ReductionOfPutPriceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_ZyzZ3l5P0EmTlnJQdQUV_Q">2,000</ix:nonFraction>, as described above, with the remaining $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_16_2023_To_10_16_2023_iKGVVTI8XUO88qfLMq9agw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:NotesReduction" scale="3" id="Narr_gYI0UgXXvEy6UB36Id23-w">500</ix:nonFraction> payable by the Company on the Maturity Date recorded as Other long-term liabilities on the Consolidated Balance Sheets. No cash was exchanged as a result of executing the October 2023 Amendment.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-30</p></div></div>
