x:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_22_2023_vCGVJZYGfEGA4a-LvbKC9w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_1PIqCmF-TkSiQCEgqMxJdQ">12</ix:nonFraction>% secured promissory note issued to the Company&#8217;s senior lender, on behalf of and at the direction of the Company, in an aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_22_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2023Member_ctin-NOvQ0WcO0ibH3lPhw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_CWi95pgM40aoIeKdLGDWzw">2,000</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;2023 GVB Promissory Note&#8221;), (iii) assign the GVB Insurance Proceeds to the Agent until the outstanding aggregate principal amount of the Debentures, plus accrued and unpaid interest, has been repaid in full; provided that the first $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_12_22_2023_To_12_22_2023_CbIELzhSdkS7v0U0bWCCpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:UnusualOrInfrequentItemInsuranceProceeds" scale="3" id="Narr_4LHZld8TQ06hW_OPMnGTxQ">1,000</ix:nonFraction> of Insurance Proceeds in excess of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_12_22_2023_To_12_22_2023_CbIELzhSdkS7v0U0bWCCpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ThresholdLimitForInsuranceProceeds" scale="3" id="Narr_rOO2s92LxEadmsRojeqtqA">5,000</ix:nonFraction> shall be applied as stated in the agreement, and (iv) post-closing enter into a deed in lieu of foreclosure agreement with respect to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_acre_ywRwZxt6eEqx0GD7EcJwFg" contextRef="As_Of_12_22_2023_vCGVJZYGfEGA4a-LvbKC9w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AreaOfRealEstatePropertyClosed" scale="0" id="Narr_jmcIo-5yaUyF31dg-HZW7g">224</ix:nonFraction> acres of real property in Delta County, Colorado commonly known as Needle Rock Farms, resulting in a non-monetary exchange yielding additional debt reduction of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_12_22_2023_To_12_22_2023_CbIELzhSdkS7v0U0bWCCpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AdditionalDebtReduction" scale="3" id="Narr_3dAzx1HwQEGV89JT1i4tQg">1,000</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">Effective June 24, 2024, GVB Biopharma (&#8220;GVB&#8221;), the Company&#8217;s former subsidiary, made a scheduled principal and interest payment against the Company&#8217;s outstanding indebtedness to JGB, reducing the Company&#8217;s total outstanding principal indebtedness with JGB by </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_6_24_2024_To_6_24_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2023Member_us-gaap_PledgingPurposeAxis_us-gaap_BorrowingsMember_zU1tZVIOK0y1rAuxteMSsQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentIncreaseDecreaseForPeriodNet" scale="3" id="Narr_oxx9Dib-mUOaLR2nl7KyVw">1,500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">. The remaining </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_24_2024_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2023Member_z8vp5JayLUaDmVo81-h7CA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestAfterAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="3" id="Narr_tXBL1ziSQUuyoJRtwfM7kg">500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> payable by GVB under the 2023 GVB Promissory Note was initially extended to December 31, 2024, and subsequently to March 31, 2025. &#160;As of March 31, 2025, the 2023 GVB Promissory Note was in default with respect to payment at maturity of the contractual term and accordingly an allowance for credit loss was initially recorded as of March 31, 2025 in the amount of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2023Member_e5IdAYoTzUOV96KalhWxwA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossExcludingAccruedInterest" scale="3" id="Narr_DBBZVBKrpUCzrm0CAvODDQ">500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">. &#160;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;background:#ffffff;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">In connection with the September 18, 2025 full repayment of the debentures (as described below), the Company entered into a new 2025 GVB Promissory Note with GVB in the amount of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_9_18_2025_To_9_18_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2025Member_WLGWqs26qEyP9oL4sr0eGA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireNotesReceivable" scale="3" id="Narr__s_WVeG3okiadk8sNx452A">500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">, payable in installments of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_18_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2025Member_oGoVdI3DT06TV3FqKPDlgw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestAmountReceivablePerInstallment" scale="3" id="Narr_oWcVVw4Uc0OIfC7K3pSRUQ">100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> each on November 1, 2025, January 1, 2026 and February 1, 2026, with the remaining balance of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_18_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2025Member_oGoVdI3DT06TV3FqKPDlgw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestRemainingAmountReceivable" scale="3" id="Narr_ryAe7eqoHUO5pVSAEJBiew">200</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> payable over a term of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_UoK28yMY1U-sifo_4Affiw" contextRef="Duration_9_18_2025_To_9_18_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2025Member_WLGWqs26qEyP9oL4sr0eGA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentNumberOfMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_Z82YSXbJl0-zAsTqh2qNgw">31</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> monthly installments thereafter. The Company received the first payment on the 2025 GVB Promissory Note in the amount of </span><span style="background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_9_18_2025_To_9_18_2025_us-gaap_AccountsNotesLoansAndFinancingReceivableByReceivableTypeAxis_xxii_GvbPromissoryNote2025Member_WLGWqs26qEyP9oL4sr0eGA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromCollectionOfNotesReceivable" scale="3" id="Narr_jFw0veZ6KUawxeLr__aDZw">100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;">. As of December 31, 2025, the Company continues to maintain an allowance for credit loss against the 2025 GVB Promissory Note. </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">As part of the December 2023 Amendment, the Company, the Holders and the Agent also agreed to amend the Debentures to (i) allow the Holders to voluntarily convert the Debentures, in whole or in part, into shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock (&#8220;Voluntary Conversion Option&#8221;) on the earlier of (i) June 30, 2024 and (ii) the public announcement of a Fundamental Transaction at a conversion price equal to the lower of (x) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_U1a2ucfcokOiPxUSwWNu_Q">46,575.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (reverse split adjusted) and (y) the closing sale price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on June 29, 2024 (the &#8220;Conversion Price&#8221;), and (ii) include a mandatory prepayment of the outstanding principal of the Debentures in an amount equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentageOfNetCashProceedsPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_JOLI1wC5ckqTxW5nnyLD0Q">20</ix:nonFraction>% of the net cash proceeds of any issuance by the Company of any of its stock, or other Equity Interests (as defined in the Debentures) or the incurrence or issuance of any indebtedness. During the second quarter of 2025, the Company made principal payments in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_WKyhvJRqpE-4RYWWky65bQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_lyCbRutSDkC7fe0jBhStMQ">1,017</ix:nonFraction> as <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_bvL7scwuCUqLAf9BWc7F9A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentRedemptionPricePercentageOfNetCashProceedsPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_4A7AGfbviEW0PH16Z-bm-A">20</ix:nonFraction>% of the net cash proceeds of the issuance of common stock (see Note 9 &#8220;Capital Raises and Warrants for Common Stock&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Additional terms of the December 2023 Amendment include a financial covenant holiday through the third quarter of 2024 and revised certain covenants thereafter to reflect the sale of the Purchased Interests, including lowering the Company&#8217;s quarterly revenue targets. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On April 8, 2024, the Company, the Holders and the Agent entered into that certain Letter Agreement to modify the terms of the Amendment Agreement, the JGB SPA and the Debentures, as amended (&#8220;April 2024 Amendment&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Under the terms of the Letter Agreement, the Holders are permitted to convert their debt to common stock at anytime and the Conversion Price (as defined in the Debentures) at which the Holders may convert the principal amount of their Debentures to the Company&#8217;s common stock is reduced to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_6_28_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_LetterAgreementMember_6mP6M6ADw0GQb_k-0bTvCg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRightsBasedOnLowestNasdaqMinimumPrice" scale="0" id="Narr_LrRqQrUubkChl3UQbasu_A">6,644.70</ix:nonFraction> per share&#160;in accordance with applicable Nasdaq rules through the conversion option reset date on June 28, 2024. The principal amount of the Debentures converted shall be applied to the Monthly Allowance (as defined in the Debentures) for that month, and any excess shall be applied to the Monthly Allowances for the succeeding months. The conversions will be a dollar for dollar reduction of the remaining outstanding obligation owed to the Holders. The Agent and Holders have also agreed to daily limits on trading volume and minimum conversion amounts. The Holders converted $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_LetterAgreementMember_fAhKGk-N8UW7Qj5UVl_aQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="3" id="Narr_ssEt-DbzcU21_2IJa_a_Gw">428</ix:nonFraction> of debt, in exchange for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_LetterAgreementMember_fAhKGk-N8UW7Qj5UVl_aQw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_F2u2nkKB202bHEq_WCKXeg">65</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock during the quarter-ended June 30, 2024. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</span></span>On May 10, 2024, the Company, the Holders and the Agent entered into that certain May 2024 Exchange Agreement and May 2024 Letter Agreement to modify the terms of the Amendment Agreement, the Securities Purchase Agreement and the Debentures, as amended (&#8220;May 2024 Amendment&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-31</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_NX5CQKntAEuENwzCOwKXDw_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_NX5CQKntAEuENwzCOwKXDw_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Under the terms of the May 2024 Amendment, the Company and Holders have agreed the Company shall incur an aggregate amendment charge to the undersigned holders equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_5_10_2024_To_5_10_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024LetterAgreementMember__tD_W9IhmUWHvKpJzjXRDQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:AggregateAmendmentCharge" scale="3" id="Narr_V1EmOAFyZU-_LjUWN5m1cw">275</ix:nonFraction>, which shall be added to the principal balance of the Debentures. Under the terms of the May 2024 Exchange Agreement, the Company and Holders exchanged an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_5_10_2024_To_5_10_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024ExchangeAgreementMember_wdyN_Peu9Em-6C2b9DD1pg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtRelatedCommitmentFeesAndDebtIssuanceCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_e0BpP8wDmEW02jw0f1RqJA">2,328</ix:nonFraction> in principal, fees and expenses owed under the Debentures for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_5_10_2024_To_5_10_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024ExchangeAgreementMember_wdyN_Peu9Em-6C2b9DD1pg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_PHvcDWrEY0mn9RQeIHMegw">128</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_5_10_2024_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PrefundedWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024ExchangeAgreementMember_Yarsbsm-KUOKyRQspTvjBA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_GsKHLnSm9UKAddjVd8ZAPQ">289</ix:nonFraction> immediately exercisable pre-funded warrants to purchase shares of common stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_5_10_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024ExchangeAgreementMember_2qaxf2MdmUO8FEdUa6rhxg" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_c0F4kLXv5kuT8rBLeEHjtg">.00001</ix:nonFraction> (at an effective per share price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_5_10_2024_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_May2024ExchangeAgreementMember_2qaxf2MdmUO8FEdUa6rhxg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_Y6a_M3vu80eRd9sFeZA9WA">5,247.45</ix:nonFraction>). All pre-funded warrants were subsequently exercised during the quarter-ended June 30, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On August 27, 2024, the Company, the Holders and the Agent entered into that certain August 2024 Letter Agreement to modify the terms of the Amendment Agreement, the JGB SPA, and the Debentures, as amended (&#8220;August 2024 Amendment&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;">Under the terms of the August 2024 Agreement,&#160;</span><span style="color:#212529;">each Holder agreed that it shall not exercise its Holder Redemption Right (as defined in the Debentures) for more than </span><span style="color:#212529;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2024LetterAgreementMember_jFIVg7oHzU-epmQ3f3bBTA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentMaximumExerciseOfRedemptionRightPercentageOfMonthlyAllowance" scale="-2" id="Narr_UDsLA1tBv0mGNh_37OL0gQ">50</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="color:#212529;"> of its Monthly Allowance (as defined in the Debentures)&#160;</span><span style="color:#212529;">through and including July 2025. Further, the provisions in Section 3(c)(i) of the Debentures requiring </span><span style="color:#212529;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2024LetterAgreementMember_jFIVg7oHzU-epmQ3f3bBTA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentPercentageOfEquityIssuanceToBePaidToBeHoldersShallBeSuspended" scale="-2" id="Narr_0L2Htea_Xk-6K_uNfAMQuQ">20</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="color:#212529;"> of any equity issuances to be paid to the Holders shall be suspended through December 31, 2024. In consideration for the amendments set forth in the August 2024 Amendment, the Company paid an amendment fee of </span><span style="color:#212529;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2024LetterAgreementMember_jFIVg7oHzU-epmQ3f3bBTA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentPaymentOfAmendmentFee" scale="3" id="Narr_4TeAxVhnRUibwFrHLbHGAg">746</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;">, which was added to the aggregate principal amount of the Debentures. JGB subsequently issued a conversion notice for </span><span style="color:#212529;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2024LetterAgreementMember_jFIVg7oHzU-epmQ3f3bBTA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_gY4CcmdkfUCxxpTbHltb2Q">142</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;"> shares of common stock equal to principal reduction of </span><span style="color:#212529;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_8_27_2024_To_8_27_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xxii_August2024LetterAgreementMember_jFIVg7oHzU-epmQ3f3bBTA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="3" id="Narr_xp72Pm8Ym0ufvfXwQvswiw">328</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#212529;">.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="color:#212529;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On October 10, 2024, the Company, the Holders and the Agent entered into that certain October 2024 Letter Agreement to modify the terms of the Amendment Agreement, the JGB SPA, and the Debentures, as amended (&#8220;October 2024 Amendment&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Under the terms of the October 2024 Amendment, the Company will be able to reset the Conversion Price (as defined in the Debentures) currently in effect, at the discretion of the Board of Directors and on a one time basis, to an amount equal to the average of the daily VWAPs for each of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_VvEcJn3tiEe5ibeBcTG2kA" contextRef="Duration_10_10_2024_To_10_10_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_fVqVZsX2LUWbOxuLeDjHRw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays1" scale="0" id="Narr_7KwJUXzfLUuWP6M_FLyNyw">five</ix:nonFraction> (5) consecutive Nasdaq trading days immediately preceding the date on which the Conversion Price shall be reset. The reset Conversion Price shall in no event be greater than the Conversion Price in effect on the date of the Letter Agreement, which is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_10_10_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_kmeMkkQoxUGyWB_GgDZdgw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_AaO9mEaVYESPs8BqpoViKA">2,315.71</ix:nonFraction>. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On January 13, 2025, the Board of Directors approved the reset of the Conversion Price to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_1_13_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_WJPKPhkUukaz3SjMij23aQ" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_QWAW_g0H20aRh4EGv9lwyw">2,083.8</ix:nonFraction> per share. The change in conversion price resulted in an increase in fair value to the embedded conversion option, resulting in an increase in debt discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2025_To_1_13_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_5QvplicokkuV_j9NNwQNdA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentIncreaseInDebtDiscount" scale="3" id="Narr_xBETjmdTnUu0AjqfxoAzLQ">283</ix:nonFraction> and a corresponding increase in capital in excess of par value. The Holders exercised conversion notices in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2025_To_1_13_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_5QvplicokkuV_j9NNwQNdA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmount1" scale="3" id="Narr_g-VjkYuc8UipuZ0hVYSWdA">3,132</ix:nonFraction> in January 2025 and the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_1_13_2025_To_1_13_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredDebenturesMember_5QvplicokkuV_j9NNwQNdA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_sGPfgkkneEurwEWxYq-KzA">1,504</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. &#160; </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On May 22, 2025, the Company, the Holders and the Agent entered into that certain May 2025 Letter Agreement to modify the terms of the Amendment Agreement, the JGB SPA, and the Debentures, as amended (&#8220;May 2025 Amendment&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Under the terms of the May 2025 Amendment, the Company will be able to reset the Conversion Price (as defined in the Debentures) currently in effect, at the discretion of the Board of Directors and on a one time basis, to an amount equal to the average of the daily VWAPs for each of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_VvEcJn3tiEe5ibeBcTG2kA" contextRef="Duration_5_22_2025_To_5_22_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_v_yR1cVChk6RICm-ISL4Vg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays1" scale="0" id="Narr_wJxn74ou30al9h6O0RYlug">five</ix:nonFraction> (5) consecutive Nasdaq trading days immediately preceding the date on which the Conversion Price shall be reset. The reset Conversion Price shall in no event be greater than the Conversion Price in effect on the date of the Letter Agreement, which is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_5_22_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xxii_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_32mHJW-VT0q_IQ1qYRhwiQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" scale="0" id="Narr_fFXUqQwykkeBwU5-uR3wOg">138.92</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On September 18, 2025, the Company repaid in full all outstanding obligations under, and terminated, the Senior Secured Credit Facility, the Debentures, and the related security and collateral documents. In connection with the payoff and termination, the Company paid the outstanding principal, accrued and unpaid interest, and all other amounts then due and payable, totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_18_2025_CHB2VKCldE6YEq9eobgXcw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentAnnualPrincipalPayment" scale="3" id="Narr_YKti7wRXdUmucF62Cg86gA">3,790</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate principal payments made between August 29, 2025 and September 18, 2025, from the proceeds of the August 2025 Series A convertible preferred stock offering (see Note 9 &#8220;Capital Raises and Warrants for Common Stock&#8221;). All liens and security interests securing the Debentures and related obligations were released. The Company also paid a prepayment penalty of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_9_18_2025_To_9_18_2025__H547Ttpd0mUkm-xcEXMCg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentPenaltyPaid" scale="3" id="Narr_Igp_u_awr0q-MeQDu968ag">28</ix:nonFraction> and recorded extinguishment charges of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_9_18_2025_To_9_18_2025__H547Ttpd0mUkm-xcEXMCg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtExtinguishmentCost" scale="3" id="Narr_AEAWwoTUfU2OLxlAnJo2TQ">416</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">In accordance with ASC 470-60, <i style="font-style:italic;">Troubled Debt Restructurings by Debtors,</i> and ASC 470-50, <i style="font-style:italic;">Debt Modifications and Extinguishment</i>, the Company performed an assessment of whether the related transaction was deemed to be a troubled debt restructuring, and if no, whether the transaction was deemed modification of existing debt, or an extinguishment of existing debt and new debt. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-32</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_NX5CQKntAEuENwzCOwKXDw_cont4" continuedAt="Tb_NX5CQKntAEuENwzCOwKXDw_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The October 2023 Amendment, April 2024 Amendment, May 2024 Amendment, August 2024 Amendment, January 2025 Amendment, and May 2025 Amendment were concluded to be a modification, and not an extinguishment, based on an analysis of the present value of future cash flows. A new effective interest rate was determined, and the debt continued to be amortized. The December 2023 Amendment was concluded to be an extinguishment, due to the addition of a substantive conversion option. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="background:#ffffff;">The Company analyzed the conversion feature of the December 2023 Amendment for derivative accounting consideration under ASC 815-15 and determined that the embedded conversion features should be classified as a bifurcated derivative because the exercise price of these convertible notes is subject to a variable conversion rate. The Company has determined that the conversion feature is not considered to be solely indexed to the Company&#8217;s own stock and is therefore not afforded equity treatment. In accordance with ASC 815, the Company has bifurcated the conversion feature of the note and recorded a derivative liability </span>at fair value in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_n_oQ_32ZRU-U_r6BZMT13A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmbeddedDerivativeFairValueOfEmbeddedDerivativeLiability" scale="3" id="Narr_Z-8F_qTPIUCyzcM0I3st_Q">557</ix:nonFraction> as of March 31, 2024, as a component of Other Long-Term Liabilities on the Consolidated Balance Sheets. Subsequently, during the year-ended December 31, 2024, the derivative liability related to the debentures and embedded conversion option was reclassified from Other Long-Term Liabilities to Capital in Excess of Par, based on the Company&#8217;s reassessment of the classification and conclusion the derivative met the &#8216;fixed for fixed&#8217; criteria in ASC 815.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Subordinated Note</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On March 3, 2023, the Company executed a Subordinated Promissory Note (the &#8220;Subordinated Note&#8221;) with a principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_3_2023_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_3SKTWvj0VUygVSwMBpM2Gg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_1U1fV8WaF0OSIQdZukmemg">2,865</ix:nonFraction> in favor of Omnia Ventures, LP (&#8220;Omnia&#8221;). </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">In connection with the Subordinated Note, the Company issued to Omnia, warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_3_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_OmniaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_R6ZgLx8XUEWBOfl33fhmOw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_IeVLGfCnwEmbO5Idz-78eg">1</ix:nonFraction> share of the Company&#8217;s common stock (the &#8220;2023 Omnia Warrants&#8221;). The 2023 Omnia Warrants were exercisable for <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_9_3_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_OmniaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_R6ZgLx8XUEWBOfl33fhmOw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_sFMVuY0T3EiYNv5oaWKAIQ">seven years</ix:nonNumeric> from September 3, 2023, at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_9_3_2023_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_OmniaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_R6ZgLx8XUEWBOfl33fhmOw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_L33gtIe5LU2w5tnEP1IL-Q">637,295</ix:nonFraction> per share, subject, with certain exceptions, to adjustments in the event of stock splits, dividends, subsequent dilutive offerings and certain fundamental transactions. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On April 29, 2024, the Company entered into a General Release and Settlement Agreement (the &#8220;Omnia Agreement&#8221;) with Omnia Capital LP (&#8220;Omnia&#8221;). The Omnia Agreement settled and extinguished all outstanding debt and interest owed to Omnia under the Subordinated Note and the put provision contained in the 2023 Omnia Warrants, amounting to a total of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_XH5bm7u55UK05Nrb5DIanQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_s24Yr1s9AE6ixEKaYNIPog">5,228</ix:nonFraction>, for (i) a cash payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_GFNMTZA_6Ey4RXA9yhRWIw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:PaymentMadeByCompanyToReduce" scale="3" id="Narr_HTfmCKQypUiNc6LaROe5zA">249</ix:nonFraction>; (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_GFNMTZA_6Ey4RXA9yhRWIw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_xXCUVTiY606LsqCuUQWqnA">371</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_D59bL6oIe0SOD3xHun-AEQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_PrefundedWarrantsMember_-n-owee100moi8T8dr0Izg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="