e holder to require the Company to redeem the 2024 Omnia Warrants, no earlier than May 1, 2025, for a purchase price equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jGdyiQltb0iRZe-B1WIKtA" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xxii_NewWarrantsMember_Og71ukEtlkmcXdBRvp_YYw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_L8eR0y_rJ06uhSsvYdhffQ">8,306</ix:nonFraction> per warrant, and had an initial fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_lURDWcfrQ0iSXdw6ifTbpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityIssues" scale="3" id="Narr_Q4kArDTuH0erA9Wckf33Cg">1,515</ix:nonFraction> (see Note 8 &#8220;Fair Value Measurements&#8221;). The put option of the 2024 Omnia Warrants was fully exercised on September 29, 2025 in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_10_2_2025_To_10_2_2025_us-gaap_FairValueByLiabilityClassAxis_xxii_Omnia2024WarrantsMember_uEoTyhrk_Eygo2J1VK0FRw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilitySettlements" scale="3" id="Narr_UV7kRjOb4EOGkJjVjbC7kw">1,231</ix:nonFraction> and paid on October 2, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Subject to limited exceptions, a holder of pre-funded warrants and 2024 Omnia Warrants will not have the right to exercise any portion of its warrants if the holder, together with its affiliates, would beneficially own in excess of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_DNleCvw89Eac4AWA9BeXzA" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_GFNMTZA_6Ey4RXA9yhRWIw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:MaximumBeneficialOwnershipPercentageToBeHeldByHoldersToExerciseWarrants" scale="-2" id="Narr_dM4HSkzHwEaDtX5vcsQxLA">19.99</ix:nonFraction>% of the number of shares of our common stock outstanding immediately after giving effect to such exercise. As part of the Omnia Agreement, the parties agreed to terminate and cancel the Old Note and the 2023 Omnia Warrants and released all debts, claims or other obligations against each other occurring prior to the date of the Omnia Agreement. &#160;The total cash and non-cash consideration amounted to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_lURDWcfrQ0iSXdw6ifTbpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:CashAndNonCashConsiderationForDebtTermination" scale="3" id="Narr_LCUSvw_4PUGThJDsIrGgOg">5,628</ix:nonFraction>, resulting in extinguishment charges of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="Duration_4_29_2024_To_4_29_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xxii_OmniaCapitalLpMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_SubordinatedDebtMember_lURDWcfrQ0iSXdw6ifTbpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:DebtExtinguishmentCost" scale="3" id="Narr_gDNHPMxVS0CS8XymCkqw-A">400</ix:nonFraction> for the year ended December 31, 2024, recorded in Interest expense in the Consolidated Statements of Operations and Comprehensive Loss. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-33</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_DLobDgj4TkutPNVSBAEV-w_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_zl5H20qQaE6Nq8WyHRXWFA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_WfkPrSE3ZUCYNbZ1aU8xEg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_DPa3GTdXokKL4RSHV2xYdw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_d9fShD6TzUOhY0FdrdRiCA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_zVs9epb0UUaLEAWeXpFy2w_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_3EqlM9sItUKjvT0RobqPKQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_nVeVsSkztEa929JwTr_nVw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_Tm86pcZ380WWLaRGU4eLNA_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_96ZLY-GsLk2w3gqoVUC99Q_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_eJweYE77dEi7xnziYTFUGw_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_gyDXp7fIEEmUL0ymtL2uOg_10_2"></a><a id="Tc_zG3rT2FXqUWyssMlqZJHfg_10_3"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_NX5CQKntAEuENwzCOwKXDw_cont5"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Debt Issuance Costs</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The fair values of the warrants at issuance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:WarrantsFairValueDisclosure" scale="3" id="Narr_KifSorubYUSyFmf5ZI5Wrg">5,791</ix:nonFraction>, together with the Debentures original issuance discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredFinanceCostsNet" scale="3" id="Narr_LRcMwLkGkUeKwwz4AncXaw">1,053</ix:nonFraction>, Debentures exit payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDO