piration" scale="3" id="Narr_kbniiq8kMUupbLTVkOV6oA">228,923</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025 that do not expire. The Company also accumulated US federal NOL carryforward of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2017_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_US_BwdCYyB5SkW4Nc0-Hjqasw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:OperatingLossCarryforwardsSubjectToExpiration" scale="3" id="Narr_zX2exR9AGEGR9-mbE-lWjA">46,920</ix:nonFraction> through December 31, 2017 and these NOL carryforwards begins to expire in 2030. In addition to the US federal NOL carryforward, the Company has state NOL carryforwards of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_us-gaap_StateAndLocalJurisdictionMember_Y-mPs8ixQUyGBHUc0DuZfA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xxii:OperatingLossCarryforwardsSubjectToExpiration" scale="3" id="Narr_1WipNdfN902RnLFlcVU4IA">104,844</ix:nonFraction> in various jurisdictions in which it files that will begin to expire in 2031. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025, the Company has a research and development credit carryforward of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsTaxCreditCarryforwardsResearch" scale="3" id="Narr_9u8Zmw5pPUiQiI8tD912Nw">1,654</ix:nonFraction> that begins to expire in 2030. The Company has a capital loss carryover of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_n90YrcoxwU-etnDORmfifQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_S-ImCJ9T5kaTvyelbAvd5A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="3" id="Narr_aUCTrccJDEywdVKV9DjM5Q">11,188</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025, that begins to expire in 2026. Utilization of these ca