LTI"), foreign-derived intangible income ("FDII"), and base erosion and anti-abuse tax ("BEAT"). The impact of the OBBB on the Company is accelerating the expensing of the domestic research and development costs.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-36</p></div></div>
